model { extend basalt.deployment { metadata { constraint "A deploy-time command whose outcome a resource reads is keyed on what it reads and carries no attempt identity: the source namespace, pool size, migration and pool database commands on every stage. A plan cannot know the outcome of a command that runs on every plan, so every resource waiting on one would plan as an update forever. The migration's key is the sources its imports reach, the hosted server and the workspace packages, and the lockfile, without the two files rewritten for every revision. These commands therefore run only when their inputs change. A check that must run on every release reads no resource and belongs to the release entry, before apply." } } }
